# What is NOT published, and why. Everything else in this tree ships.
#
# Two rules of thumb: a file that a tool in tools/ writes is not committed, and
# a file that is somebody else's to distribute is not committed. Anything that
# is a build INPUT is committed even when it looks like a working file.


# ---- generated by the tools in tools/ ----------------------------------
# Both are written on every run of the script that owns them, and both exist to
# be looked at during a rebuild rather than shipped.
tools/pages_preview.png                 # make_pages.py
tools/category-sources/badges_vs_originals.png   # make_category_icons.py


# ---- BG Wiki's files, not ours -----------------------------------------
# The originals the region badges are derived from. Re-fetchable with
# tools/category-sources/fetch_icons.py, which re-derives their URLs from
# questmarks' page cache and rewrites the manifest below.
#
# icons/manifest.json is NOT ignored: it is the attribution record and the
# input make_category_icons.py reads to build SOURCES.json. Keep it.
tools/category-sources/icons/*.png


# ---- live saved settings ------------------------------------------------
# Windower writes this on first run and rewrites it as you play. It holds the
# character names on this install, which repeatable quests each of them has been
# seen to finish, and a window position and scale that would override the code
# defaults for anyone who cloned it.
data/settings.xml


# ---- machine-local junk -------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.stackdump
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
